# CMake / build files

Follow the Build-file discipline section in [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).

Reminders:

- Edit build files carefully; prefer focused `*.cmake` modules loaded when needed
- Any build-script change must update `CHANGELOG.md` with clear what/why for human reviewers
- Keep the project buildable with GNU build essentials + CMake, targeting C++17
